  "notable_quotes": [
    "A solvent-stable anionic Zn(II) MOF, {[(CH3)2NH2]2[Zn5(TDA)4(TZ)4]·4DMF}n, with a uninodal 6-connected pcu topology was synthesized.",
    "Protonated dimethylammonium counterions generated from DMF decomposition can be exchanged with Eu3+ or Tb3+ to form Eu3+@1 and Tb3+@1.",
    "Eu3+ post-functionalization improves the sensitivity of MOF 1 toward aniline and benzaldehyde, whereas this enhancement is reported specifically for Eu3+ not Tb3+."
  ],
